      "description": "Selected workspace navigation with lime icon and readable active label.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Ish maydoni\"><p class=\"ds-nav-label\">ISH MAYDONI</p><button class=\"ds-nav-item ds-nav-selected\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 2v20M17 2v20M2 12h20M2 7h5M2 17h5M17 7h5M17 17h5\"/></svg>Video studiyo</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\">Loyihalarim</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--font,'Manrope',sans-serif);background:var(--dark,#232b2b);padding:18px;border-radius:8px}.ds-nav-label{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.6px;font-weight:700;color:#a4afa9;padding:0 14px;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-nav-item{font-family:var(--font,'Manrope',sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;text-align:left;color:#bec7c1;padding:13px;border:0;border-radius:8px;margin:4px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;background:none;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:#303a36;color:white}.ds-nav-item.ds-nav-selected{background:#3a453d;color:#e5f5cf}.ds-nav-selected svg{color:var(--green,#d7f594)}.ds-primary:focus-visible,.ds-secondary:focus-visible,.ds-export:focus-visible,.ds-icon:focus-visible,.ds-text:focus-visible,.ds-nav-item:focus-visible,.ds-scene-number:focus-visible,.ds-chapter:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7c9364;outline-offset:3px;}"
