      "description": "Flat white bordered container with a compact title and muted footer.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-heading\"><h2>Reklamangizni yarating</h2><span>Yangi loyiha</span></div><div class=\"ds-panel-body\">Matnni o‘zgartiring — prevyuda darhol ko‘rinadi.</div><div class=\"ds-panel-footer\">Sinov mahsuloti bilan boshlang</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:var(--font,'Manrope',sans-serif);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#262c2c);border:1px solid var(--line,#e8ebec);border-radius:var(--radius,14px);overflow:hidden}.ds-panel-heading{padding:22px 24px 20px}.ds-panel-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.4px;font-weight:750}.ds-panel-heading span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#707779);margin-top:6px}.ds-panel-body{padding:22px 24px 15px;font-size:11px;color:#616c62}.ds-panel-footer{background:#fafbf9;padding:13px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e8ebec);font-size:9px;color:#616c62}"
